<title>USA: Lin Television Corp Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Lin Television Corp Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>PROVIDENCE, R.I. 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.23		    $0.20</p>
<p> Net			  7,137		    5,952</p>
<p> Revs			61,662		   57,539</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	30,379		   29,971</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said Q1 1997 revenue and broadcast cash flow increased as a result of higher advertising time sales and increased network compensation.</p>
</text>
